5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should be cautious about the long-term financial viability of any program we select.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic suggests we examine the outcomes of previous attempts before blindly adding more to the list.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. I'm also concerned about how these programs affect our staff's daily workload and balance.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure the hospital can actually handle more people! We need to check the space.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so important that we support one another. I wonder why some of our past projects didn't last.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, that is a fair point. We must ensure the infrastructure supports the ambition.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, your curiosity is noted. I will look into the actual data from previous trials.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the staffing levels to see where we have room to breathe.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the parking and the booking system to see if there's any space left!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think I shall look into the board minutes and the nursing rounds to see where things faltered.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the ledger and the regional fund tariffs to understand the true costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
