60,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Candidate A and D are off-site or external, meaning no tariffs and high risk. I prefer B or C.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"A is proven to help patients, but the visit completion data makes it logically unsound. I vote C.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,C fits perfectly with the midwifery slack I found. It supports families without straining ward nurses.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"B needs a ""dedicated space,"" but the rooms are already full! C uses consultations and classes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"C is joint, which worries me, but the midwifery slack makes it more feasible than others.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"C is on-site, which secures the tariff and protects our limited development budget.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"D requires data agreements with outside surgeries, which we know take forever to sign.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,I believe C will bring a lot of joy to the community and balance our staffing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm with Midori! C seems like the best fit for our crowded halls.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we ensure the pediatric and midwifery departments agree on the rota, C is a lovely choice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. C is the most fiscally responsible and sustainable option.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,The logic is consistent. C avoids the pitfalls of the other three candidates.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I am very happy we found a solution that considers the staff's well-being.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,Yay! Let's go with the one that doesn't need more parking spaces!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It is a wonderful way to care for the new mothers and their little ones.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
